  {
   "id": "_9_D09TwEAAJ",
   "from": "Edward Rigdon",
   "author": "99a06696c483481a",
   "date": "2019-01-10T20:34:31Z",
   "subject": "Re: help with \"ERROR: data object of class list\" message",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div>I believe this error message means what it says. Your data is supposed to be in a data.frame but it appears to be in a list. Convert the data object to a data frame and then try again.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">CFAdata&lt;-as.data.frame(CFAdata)</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Maybe that works.<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"auto\"></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
