    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Thursday, January 10, 2019 at 3:34:31 PM UTC-5, Edward Rigdon wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"auto\"><div>I believe this error message means what it says. Your data is supposed to be in a data.frame but it appears to be in a list. Convert the data object to a data frame and then try again.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">CFAdata&lt;-as.data.frame(CFAdata)</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Maybe that works.<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\" dir=\"auto\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Thu, Jan 10, 2019, 2:24 PM R David Lebel &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">rdavi...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">Hi,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">I’m new to using lavaan so apologize if this is a basic\r\nquestion. I’m trying to run a CFA and have successfully installed the lavaan\r\npackage and read my data in from SPSS. </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">I copied the code from the lavaan tutorial, updated it\r\nfor my data and am receiving the following error. See code and error message\r\nbelow:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10\">firstmodel &lt;-</span> <span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10\">&#39; x =~ reliden1 + reliden2 + reliden3 + reliden4</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;text-autospace:none\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10\">m =~ disc1 + disc2 + disc3\r\n+ disc4 + disc5</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10\">y =~ proactskill1 + proactskill2 + proactskill3 + proactskill4 &#39;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">&gt; fit &lt;- cfa(firstmodel, data=CFAdata)</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">Error in lavData(data = data, group = group, cluster = cluster,\r\nov.names = OV.NAMES,<span>  </span>: </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span>  </span>lavaan ERROR: data object of\r\nclass list</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">Any help in fixing this error is appreciated.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">thanks,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">Dave<br></span></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">lav...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424443870000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0AWORcQqSnBPp1te5lIVTG\">https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424443870000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2SbWu_5JypeP3qrQVAGykQ\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
